h 2023.\n\n#### Amenities\n\n#### Pricing, Floor Plans & Room Sizing","score":0.80771893,"raw_content":null,"id":"0af91f-00"},{"url":"https://www.addressofchoice.com/romell-allure-borivali-east-mumbai-p49939","title":"Romell Allure in Borivali East, Mumbai Details | Reviews | Price","content":"Possession at Romell Allure will begin in 2022-12-22, and the project is RERA registered under P51800023445 Units. Developed by Romell Group, this project","score":0.7593865,"raw_content":null,"id":"f05268-01"},{"url":"https://www.magicbricks.com/romell-allure-borivali-east-mumbai-pdpid-4d4235313835393837","title":"Romell Allure in Borivali East, Mumbai - MagicBricks","content":"Available on 20 floor, this apartment covers carpet area 587 sqft. The project is RERA approved and P51800023445 is the RERA number of the society. Properties","score":0.72907686,"raw_content":null,"id":"672ebd-02"},{"url":"https://prophunt.ai/projects/romell-allure-borivali-east","title":"Romell Allure - Borivali East, Mumbai | PropHunt | PropHunt","content":"### 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Romell Allure\n\nresidential\n\nAn elegant two-bedroom, hall, and kitchen residence is available for purchase in Romell Allure. This west-facing property offers a carpet area of 575 square feet and is situated on a higher floor, complete with tower parking. Residents will benefit from a range of amenities, including a terrace garden with a swimming pool and a gymnasium. The location is highly convenient, being in close proximity to the Western Express Highway, Borivali National Park, schools, hospitals, a cinema, and a market.\n\n2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali\n\nresidential\n\n### 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali\n\nresidential [...] ### 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Romell Allure\n\nresidential\n\nAn elegant two-bedroom, hall, and kitchen residence is available for purchase in Romell Allure. This west-facing property offers a carpet area of 575 square feet and is situated on a higher floor, complete with tower parking. Residents will benefit from a range of amenities, including a terrace garden with a swimming pool and a gymnasium. The location is highly convenient, being in close proximity to the Western Express Highway, Borivali National Park, schools, hospitals, a cinema, and a market.\n\n2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali\n\nresidential\n\n### 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali\n\nresidential [...] ### 2 BHK Flat for Sale in Borivali\n\nresidential\n\nAn elegant 2BHK flat is available for sale in Romell Allure. This property boasts a carpet area of 587 square feet and is located on a higher floor. It includes amenities such as tower parking, a terrace garden with a swimming pool, and a gym. The location is conveniently situated near the Western Express Highway, Borivali National Park, schools, hospitals, cinemas, and markets, offering excellent connectivity and essential facilities within reach. The property is currently available for sale, with the price available upon request.\n\n## Locality & Connectivity\n\neducation\n\n1 nearby\n\nVishal Haribhau Chavan College\n\nNearby\n\nleisure\n\n1 nearby\n\nShivshahi Nisarg Aangan\n\nNearby\n\ntransit\n\n1 nearby\n\nBorivali Nancy Colony Bus Stand\n\nNearby\n\nutility","score":0.72698855,"raw_content":null,"id":"56c05f-03"},{"url":"https://housiey.com/projects/romell-allure","title":"Romell Allure Borivali East - Brochure, Pros&Cons, PriceSheet","content":"Carpet Area 407-586 sqft. The all-inclusive price of a 1BHK in Romell Allure starts from ₹1.05 Cr and varies depending on the carpet area and","score":0.7018975,"raw_content":null,"id":"7a1153-04"},{"url":"https://www.propertycrow.com/mumbai/propertyview_romell-allure-borivali-east_6370.html","title":"Romell Allure Borivali East Mumbai - PropertyCrow.com","content":"Price. 1 BHK, 407 Sq.ft Carpet Area, 91.00 Lacs. 1 BHK, 417 Sq.ft Carpet Area, 93.23 Lacs. 2 BHK, 567 Sq.ft Carpet Area, 1.23 CR. 2 BHK, 574 Sq.ft Carpet Area","score":0.6675167,"raw_content":null,"id":"ef5480-05"}],"response_tim